      "created_at": "2016-12-23T18:18:34Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-12-23T18:18:34Z",
      "body": "@jacobyn I wondered if that was the case too - it has happened before. However, this error has now happened a couple of times in the past few days and whereas before workers changed the worker id to something ridiculous (e.g. \"ayyylmao\") all recent instances have resembled normal AWS worker ids, they are just longer. Given that AWS has resumed development on MTurk and I have noticed it behaving in a couple of other unusual ways I think this might actually be a change in MTurk's policy on worker id length.",
